Package: ECHO
Type: Package
Title: Exome Coverage and HMM Optimizer
Version: 0.3.0
Author: TL
Maintainer: TL <lavauxt@gmail.com>
Description: A modular R package for processing BAM files, extracting coverage, computing quality metrics, and calling/plotting CNVs using the ExomeDepthHMM algorithm. Supports BED preprocessing using curated RefSeq Select annotations, exon-level mapping, VCF export, and a self-contained interactive HTML report (multi-sample, with QC and chromosome-scope warnings) whose CSS and JavaScript are embedded in the package code. Off-target (HorsROI) intervals are kept, left unnumbered and shown as labelled blocks in every plot.
